Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菜单上有什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's on the menu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.15,0:00:39.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能是咸鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could be ceviche
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.51,0:00:42.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭臭的  那是彭彭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stinky-oo, it's Pumbaa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.32,0:00:46.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  我跟你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to tell you, Timon...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:49.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这首歌真是让我感动极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that song always gets me right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.26,0:00:50.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  彭彭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.99,0:00:53.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, enough of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.80,0:00:57.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  你在干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:00:59.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我快转到我们出现的地方啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fast forwarding to the part where we come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:02.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你不能这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you can't go out of order.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.44,0:01:04.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才怪  我的猪朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Au contraire, my porcine pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.47,0:01:06.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遥控器在我手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got the remote.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.41,0:01:09.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这样大家会搞混了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But everyone's going to get confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.51,0:01:12.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得从故事一开始看起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to go back to the beginning of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:15.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,故事一开始没有我们啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not in the beginning of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.65,0:01:17.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有  我们一直都在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we were... the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.05,0:01:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有  我们一直都在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we were... the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.65,0:01:21.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  可是观众不知道啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but they don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:23.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那何不告诉大家我们的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why don't we tell them our story?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.09,0:01:28.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我有个点子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, l've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:29.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉大家我们的故事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we tell them our story?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢那个点子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.43,0:01:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是带着观众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little backstage tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:37.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到后台参观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take them behind the scenes for a revealing and intimate look...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.01,0:01:40.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在幕后观赏戏中戏一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the story within the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.11,0:01:42.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为观众不知道  我们怎么会  在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because what they don't know is how we really were there...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.34,0:01:44.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们一直都在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even though they didn't know we were there, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.28,0:01:46.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't have said it better myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.35,0:01:47.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  我们要从头看起了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, does this mean we're going back to the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.32,0:01:50.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  彭彭  不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, Pumbaa, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.99,0:01:53.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要从故事开始...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going way back...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:56.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的更早之前说起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to before the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.67,0:02:05.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《狮子王3：丁满彭彭历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.57,0:02:11.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,荣耀石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pride Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:14.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如此雄伟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So maestic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:16.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真威武\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.95,0:02:20.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真...  奇怪的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So bizarrely named.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.32,0:02:23.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,岩石怎么会荣耀  只是块石头啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, how can a rock be proud? It's a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.89,0:02:27.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜是因为狮子是万兽之王吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's because a pride is what they call a group of lions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.29,0:02:30.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  狮子得到荣耀石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, sure, the lions get Pride ock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:31.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们这些狐獴呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what about us meerkats?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:34.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我所生长的地方  没啥值得一提的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where I come from, we didn't have nothing to be proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.53,0:02:36.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那啥...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.53,0:02:40.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我还是只小狐獴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was a young meerkat
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:46.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当他还是只小狐獴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he was a young meerkat
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:47.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.81,0:02:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.81,0:02:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许带他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But maybe it would be safer...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.08,0:02:51.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看我的故乡比较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I just show them where I came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.85,0:02:54.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  我们能看看你成长的地方?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, boy! Do we get to see where you grew up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  只是不太雅观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Pumbaa, but it ain't pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.19,0:02:59.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请坐下  还没有拍完呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please remain seated while the camera is in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.37,0:03:12.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.10,0:03:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从荣耀石到这个令人羞愧的窝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From Pride rock to the pity of shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.97,0:03:20.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在食物链的很下层  我们生活在地底下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're so slow on the food chain, we're underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.11,0:03:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以不相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you don't have to take my word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但听听我的狐獴同胞们怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll ust let my fellow meerkats do the talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.05,0:03:26.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么  那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that, what was what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.45,0:03:27.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么  那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.05,0:03:29.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里  什么  在哪里  那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where, what, where, where, What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.65,0:03:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘘...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.69,0:03:35.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快呀  土狼要来啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick, before the hyena come
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:36.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安全啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:41.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挖个地道  挖呀挖  挖个地道  挖呀挖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Digga tunnah, dig, digga tunnah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.63,0:03:44.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你完成  就有一个大地道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you're done, you dig a bigger tunnah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:46.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挖个地道  挖呀挖  挖个地道  挖呀挖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Digga tunnah, dig, digga tunnah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快  在土狼来之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick, before the hyena come
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:48.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快  在土狼来之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick, before the hyena come
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.34,0:03:51.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挖个地道  挖呀挖  挖个地道  挖呀挖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dig, digga tunnah, dig, digga tunnah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:53.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不停地挖呀  永远也挖不完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could dig and never get done
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.64,0:03:55.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挖个地道  挖呀挖  挖个地道  挖呀挖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Digga tunnah, dig, digga tunnah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.51,0:03:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快  在土狼来之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick before the hyena come, dig
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:03.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挖地道是我们的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Digga tunnah is what we do
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.38,0:04:05.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生命就像是地道  等待我们挖掘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life's a tunnah we're diggin' through
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:07.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挖地道为我们所歌颂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Digga tunnah is what we sing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.89,0:04:10.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挖地道就是我们的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Digga tunnah is everything
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.39,0:04:12.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泥和土是狐獴的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mud and clay is a meerkat's friend
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.76,0:04:15.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布满于每个角落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always more around every bend
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.23,0:04:16.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无止无尽的泥和土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when you get to your tunnah's end
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.43,0:04:20.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈利路亚  继续挖呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hallelujah, let's dig again, dig
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.40,0:04:22.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挖个地道  挖呀挖  挖个地道  挖呀挖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Digga tunnah, dig, digga tunnah
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:24.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你完成  就有一个大地道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When it's done, you dig a bigger tunnah
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:26.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挖个地道  挖呀挖  挖个地道  挖呀挖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Digga tunnah, dig, digga tunnah
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.74,0:04:29.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.41,0:04:31.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快  在土狼来之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick, before the hyena come
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.64,0:04:32.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挖呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dig
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.65,0:04:34.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon! Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.75,0:04:37.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有看到我儿子?  他有没有经过这里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you seen my son? Has he been through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.12,0:04:38.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.55,0:04:39.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挖地道啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dig, digga tunnah
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.99,0:04:42.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦斯叔叔?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Max?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:45.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张  你看到丁满没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Max, relax. Have you seen Timon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:48.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没看到  今天还真不赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I haven't, and what a day it's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.23,0:04:50.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有骨折  没有擦伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No fractures, no lacerations...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:53.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有脑震荡  没有挫伤  或任何形式种类的伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no concussions, contusions, or injuries of any sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.37,0:04:54.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a matter of fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里没有任何丁满工作过的迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's no sign of Timon's handiwork anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.21,0:05:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那应该是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.38,0:05:11.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.59,0:05:15.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  大家好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:18.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好样的  丁满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice work, Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:21.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-干得好啊  闯祸大王  -除了他  谁会开天窗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Way to go, tunnel klutz. - Who else could break a hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.96,0:05:24.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一星期四次  又创记录了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four in one week... a new record.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:25.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么搞的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  这叫天窗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? It's called a skylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.71,0:05:37.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很有创意吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. lsn't that creative?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.14,0:05:40.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天窗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A skylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.41,0:05:43.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会跟他谈谈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll just have a word with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:46.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想为我们可悲的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just trying to shed a little light...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.15,0:05:48.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,增添一点光彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on our pathetic existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.92,0:05:51.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  不能再乱来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon, this can't go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.06,0:05:55.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个月你已捅破了四面墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just this month, you've pulled down four walls...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.23,0:05:58.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞塌了两个出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and collapsed two tunnel exits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.20,0:06:00.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该互相照顾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to look after each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.13,0:06:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这样才能生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our survival depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:04.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么用呢  我们就知道挖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the point? All we do is dig...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.14,0:06:06.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挖了后藏起来  藏起后再挖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we can hide, and hide so we can dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.67,0:06:11.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想到不用挖洞的地方去生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to be where we don't have to dig tunnels...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:14.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能在地面上抬头挺胸生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and live with our heads stuck in the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:17.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梦想有个更好的家有什么错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's so bad about dreaming of a better home?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.35,0:06:19.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要给你看样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.99,0:06:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.02,0:06:25.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来呀  看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.46,0:06:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看远方的地平线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out to the horizon...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.56,0:06:31.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿过那片树林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}past the trees...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.16,0:06:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通过那片草地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over the grasslands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:38.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阳光所照到的地方...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything the light touches...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.87,0:06:41.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都有主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}belongs to someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:46.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你要说点别的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny. I thought you were going a whole different direction with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.15,0:06:48.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能说什么  是大自然的安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can I say? It's nature's design.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.08,0:06:50.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就是其他动物的食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's right. We're food for other animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.25,0:06:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一顿移动的美食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a moveable feast...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:54.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的动物都可以享用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}feared by no one and eaten by all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:57.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是他们死后会变成草\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when they die, they become the grass...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.22,0:06:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们吃草  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we eat the grass, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:01.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对  我们吃草不消化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not exactly. We can't digest grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.59,0:07:02.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们无法忍受草\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're grass intolerant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.90,0:07:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行啦  麦斯  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, Max. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.86,0:07:05.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你帮了大忙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:08.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐獴  是别人的晚餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meerkat... it's what's for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.23,0:07:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  麦斯叔叔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Uncle Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:15.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想麦斯叔叔的头  一定多撞了一块石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think uncle Max dislodged one too many rocks with his skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:17.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他说的没错  丁满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's right, Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.04,0:07:23.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  我知道这里  一定有你可以胜任的活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I just know there's a way for you to fit in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.69,0:07:29.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  今天谁放哨?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, who's on sentry duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.79,0:07:31.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.52,0:07:34.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的儿子放哨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it... my son on sentry duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.66,0:07:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"哨兵丁满"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon the sentry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:38.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满当哨兵?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon the sentry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.97,0:07:41.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用土狼来  现在就杀了我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you save the hyenas the trouble and kill me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.80,0:07:43.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just kill me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.70,0:07:45.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说的有道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:48.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只要监视那些土狼就行啦  看到他们来了你就喊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you have to do is watch for hyenas and yell if you see one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看小乔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at Iron Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要闭上眼睛  不要到处乱看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't close your eyes! Don't look away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.04,0:07:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要有人放哨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody's got to guard us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:54.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要有人保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody's gotta protect us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.95,0:08:00.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我被你说服啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now l'm convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.49,0:08:02.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, it's outside...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:04.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在微风里  在外面的天空下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}up in the breeze, under the wide open sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.86,0:08:05.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不正是你想要的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.86,0:08:07.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你还想...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or maybe you would rather have him...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.63,0:08:09.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他继续挖洞吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}go back on the digging crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:10.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.57,0:08:15.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  就这样决定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, then we all agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  要听麦斯叔叔的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon, listen to Uncle Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.17,0:08:19.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会教你一切的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll teach you everything you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:22.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  这次要好好干啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, honey, try to make this one work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.51,0:08:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑来闻去  缩头藏尾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scurry, sniff, flinch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.68,0:08:28.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑来闻去  缩头藏尾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scurry, sniff, flinch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.08,0:08:30.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑来闻去  缩头藏尾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scurry, sniff, flinch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:32.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.52,0:08:36.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到土狼来了  你该做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what do we do if we see a hyena?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.12,0:08:37.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喊"妈咪"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scream, ''Mommy''?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.42,0:08:38.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啦  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, mister...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.86,0:08:41.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这个世界到处都是危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because the world out there is fraught with danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.19,0:08:42.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你  到处都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fraught, I tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.73,0:08:44.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊  孩子  到处都有敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, boy. It's the fraught fest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:46.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...等着把我们撕成碎片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...rip us limb from limb.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.23,0:08:48.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了  麦斯叔叔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo, Uncle Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.13,0:08:49.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拍成电影上映一定卖座\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Way to sell it to the cheap seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.77,0:08:51.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管鼓掌吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Applaud now, sonny boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.37,0:08:54.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等到没手时看你怎么鼓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but try clapping when you don't have any hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:09:00.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑来闻去  缩头藏尾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scurry, sniff, flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.45,0:09:06.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑来闻去  缩头藏尾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scurry, sniff, flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:14.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.46,0:09:17.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑来闻去  缩头藏尾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scurry, sniff, flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.23,0:09:20.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑来闻去  缩头藏尾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scurry, sniff, flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.13,0:09:23.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑来闻去  缩头藏尾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scurry, sniff, flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.60,0:09:26.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑来闻去  缩头藏尾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scurry, sniff, flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.44,0:09:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生活不该只是惊慌失措\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's more to life than panic
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.31,0:09:32.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,担心成为他人的美食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And bein' some other guy's snack, yuck
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.64,0:09:35.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也许是很好吃的健康食品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may be delicious organic
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.21,0:09:39.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我这道小菜要反抗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this little entree's fighting back
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.25,0:09:42.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不挖洞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna put digging tunnels behind me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.29,0:09:45.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要开始新的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And live at a new altitude
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.16,0:09:48.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去摘星星  为的是提醒我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna reach for the stars to remind me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:51.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐獴不是他人的食品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That meerkats are not merely food
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.93,0:09:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从现在开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For once l'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.87,0:09:58.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要照顾自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lookin' out for me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.61,0:10:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, l'll tell you what I want
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.18,0:10:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只狐獴要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This cat is movin' on
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.78,0:10:08.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他的生活  一点都不美好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a bon vivant who's missin' out on bon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.45,0:10:11.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要成为大亨  远离这片沙漠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be a bigger cheese far from the desert scene
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.42,0:10:14.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一阵凉爽的清风  一片怡人的绿地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little cooling breeze, a little patch of green
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.39,0:10:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要得意自在地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And l'll be snoozing in my hammock
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.72,0:10:17.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躺在涓涓小溪边的吊床上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By a rippling stream
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.42,0:10:20.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,远离那些洞穴  远离那些挖洞的同伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many miles from any tunnel and the digging team
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:21.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要过好日子  这就是我的信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking after number one will be my only creed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.96,0:10:22.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要过好日子  这就是我的信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking after number one will be my only creed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:23.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我所需要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all I need
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.96,0:10:24.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我所需要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all I need
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:29.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我所需要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all I need
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:31.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前我总是逃来逃去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always been good at running away
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.04,0:10:35.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我要主宰一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now I'm gonna run the show
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.14,0:10:37.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前我总被人视为盘中飧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always been seen as the ultimate prey
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.71,0:10:40.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我的地位不同以往啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now my status ain't so quo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.11,0:10:43.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个伟大的梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A dream sublime
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.28,0:10:47.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那土狼...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hyena time...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.09,0:10:48.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看  一场晚餐秀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, look, it's dinner and a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.02,0:10:52.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前我以为  只有豆芽菜跟音乐搭得上边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I thought beans were the only musical food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.03,0:10:56.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  你也好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, hi to you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  现在不是玩的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is no time for horseplay, Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.87,0:11:06.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该在上面监视...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to be up there looking out for...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.71,0:11:10.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,土狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hyenas!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.25,0:11:16.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  他们四面奔逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, look at them scramble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.22,0:11:20.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就喜欢看他们这个样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's just how I like them...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:21.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一片混乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}scrambled...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.89,0:11:25.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还到处窜来窜去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a little bit runny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:26.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,土狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hyenas!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.04,0:11:37.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:39.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么啦  疯啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you, a meshugginah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:48.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑来闻去?  缩头藏尾?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stumpy? Flinchy? Swifty?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.71,0:11:50.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算万幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, what a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.45,0:11:51.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.95,0:11:53.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦斯叔叔在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Uncle Max?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.06,0:12:00.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃命啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Max! Run for your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:01.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快装死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Play dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.66,0:12:03.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.73,0:12:06.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今秋麂皮最时髦...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suede is the look for this fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.67,0:12:09.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭  你坐在遥控器上啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, you're sitting on the remote.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.40,0:12:13.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  对不起  我以为是块饼干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh? Oh, sorry. I thought it was a brownie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.44,0:12:15.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦斯  你成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got it, Max!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.71,0:12:24.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Max!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:28.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在该跑的时候  竟然缩头藏尾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I flinched when I should've scurried.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:31.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总是很有趣  是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man. lt just never gets old, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:33.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这游戏总是玩不腻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The classics never do, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.23,0:12:45.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我应该向大家道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I owe everyone an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:48.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我犯了个小小的错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, so I made a teensy mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:52.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在放哨的时候  肯定也唱过歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like we all haven't broken into song on sentry duty before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.28,0:12:55.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唱过的  举手我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let me have a show of hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.95,0:12:57.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.95,0:13:03.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许还需要段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's a little too soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.72,0:13:06.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后谈到此事我们会开怀大笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but l'm sure we're all going to laugh about this someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.92,0:13:08.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.46,0:13:12.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.03,0:13:16.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.31,0:13:58.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝儿...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, sweetie...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.28,0:14:00.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我永远也不适合这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm never going to fit in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.71,0:14:02.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有人喜欢我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody even likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:05.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都喜欢你  宝贝儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure they do, honey. Sure they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:06.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  只有你喜欢我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides you, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:09.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了我以外...还有...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides me? There's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.59,0:14:13.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去找属于我的地方  这里不适合我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to find my place, but it isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.26,0:14:15.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里适合你  我们只是还没有发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it is. We just haven't found it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:16.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定会发现的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:18.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个主意  你可以...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's an idea. You can...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:22.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再弄头发了  妈妈  适合我的地方在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop with the hair already. My place is out there, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:27.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道那里有多远  可是我一定要去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may not know exactly where or how far, but I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:29.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  等等  如果我们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, wait, wait. I know. lf we just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.51,0:14:30.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.62,0:14:46.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝儿  我希望你能找到  属于你的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I hope you find what you're looking for, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.29,0:14:52.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:53.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你  妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.04,0:15:01.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Timmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.61,0:15:03.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的小丁满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Timmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.81,0:15:06.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.81,0:15:09.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快憋死我啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}choking. Not breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.25,0:15:15.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难怪大家会觉得我很古怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And people wonder why I have issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.79,0:15:19.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, l'll be OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:22.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I know you will. You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.11,0:15:38.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多加小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.74,0:15:40.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.98,0:15:44.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跟陌生人讲话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk to strangers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.52,0:15:46.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了  妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.35,0:15:50.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耳朵后面别忘了洗干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, wash behind your ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.39,0:15:54.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  我不是小孩儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma, l'm not a kid anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.43,0:15:56.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要独自去游泳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never go swimming without a buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.46,0:15:57.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.90,0:16:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.24,0:16:08.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.84,0:16:13.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见  妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good-bye, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.23,0:16:39.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样  情绪高昂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so, with high spirits...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.14,0:16:41.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我勇敢地出发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I boldly ventured off...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.21,0:16:44.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到狐獴从不敢去的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where no meerkat had dared to go before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.61,0:16:47.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把过去抛在脑后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put my past behind me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:50.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,决不回头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and never looked back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:16:58.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈咪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy! Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:04.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.93,0:17:07.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该朝哪个方向走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which way should I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:09.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这要看你想到哪里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That depends on what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.60,0:17:11.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真方便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.14,0:17:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无所不知的猴子即时出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enter omniscient monkey, right on cue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.57,0:17:15.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道人们怎么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you know what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.54,0:17:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,学生准备好了  老师就会出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the student is ready, the teacher appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:21.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下好了  你用不着幸运签饼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. No more fortune cookies for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.05,0:17:23.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是从哪里来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, where'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:27.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更好的问题是  你要到哪里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, the better question is, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.45,0:17:28.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个美好的地方  先生  那里...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someplace wonderful, mister, where...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.89,0:17:33.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个美好的地方  先生  那里...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someplace wonderful, mister, where...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:34.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没听到几分钟前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't happen to catch the song...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.49,0:17:36.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我唱的那首歌吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sang a few minutes ago, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.39,0:17:37.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没能欣赏到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't have the pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.03,0:17:42.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重复一下  我要到外面  一个美丽的地方去生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To recap, I want to live in some beautiful place outside...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个让我无忧无虑  不再躲藏和担忧的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a carefree place where I don't have to hide or worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.84,0:17:50.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一种无忧无虑的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life without worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.14,0:17:52.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是要找  "哈库拉马塔塔"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seek hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.21,0:17:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈库拉他个头?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harpoon a tomato?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.28,0:17:54.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈库拉马塔塔...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna Matata
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:56.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是"无忧无虑"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it means ''No worries.''
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.45,0:17:58.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好啦  用你的棍子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect. Mind taking that stick of yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.62,0:18:00.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我画个地图好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and drawing me a map, bub?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.45,0:18:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.79,0:18:07.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要想找到它  你必须超越你的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To find it, you must look beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.89,0:18:09.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the heck is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.39,0:18:14.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思就是你要超越自己的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means look beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.76,0:18:16.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越我的视线?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:21.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧这个猴子  跟我讲起哲学来啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a load of the monkey getting all existential on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越我的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.65,0:18:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越我的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.05,0:18:39.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越我的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.49,0:18:45.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这音乐让我没法子思考了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's kind of hard to think with all this music.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.50,0:18:47.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.23,0:18:48.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我感觉到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a second. It's coming to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:57.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是因为吃了鼻涕虫  就是我大彻大悟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's either that slug I ate or l'm having an epiphany.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:04.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要到那块大石头那里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to the big pointy rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.78,0:19:06.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.55,0:19:10.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只陌生猴子是谁啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was that strange monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.62,0:19:11.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.89,0:19:14.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梦想之家  我来啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dream home, here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.80,0:19:27.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.14,0:19:29.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪却很有智慧的猴子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strange but wise monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.37,0:20:01.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道  第一印象很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, first impressions are very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.50,0:20:03.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你是个滑稽演员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were a scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就吃了我吧  请你快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just eat me now... and please make it fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.38,0:20:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对疼痛的忍耐有限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a low threshold for pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:13.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张  小家伙  我不会吃你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, easy there, little guy. I'm not going to eat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.02,0:20:16.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不吃?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? You're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.02,0:20:18.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你跟踪我干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why were you stalking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.39,0:20:20.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你走过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, gee, I saw you go by...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.69,0:20:23.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得  你这个小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I figured a little fellow like you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.09,0:20:24.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不该独自出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shouldn't be out here all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.29,0:20:28.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你呢  你不也是独自一人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what about you? You're all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:29.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是独自一人  是不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are all alone, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.97,0:20:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  大多数动物  都离我远远的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Most animals give me a pretty wide berth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.47,0:20:37.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  连那些饿的也不吃你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They do? Even the hungry ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我让他们离我远远的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I drive almost everyone away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:43.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们看到我来了就躲了起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People see me coming, and they run for cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们唯恐闪躲不及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can't get out of the way fast enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.51,0:20:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是这样啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't say, you don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.68,0:20:50.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是你发光的獠牙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must be the gleam on those vicious tusks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.79,0:20:52.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把恐惧刺入了他们的心脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strikes fear into their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:56.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上  他们说  我倒他们的胃口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, they say I wreck their appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.12,0:21:00.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是你有这个...  特异功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. It's like you have this special power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.23,0:21:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特异功能?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Special power?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.76,0:21:05.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常特别的功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's pretty powerful, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.90,0:21:07.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  我雇你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect. You're hired.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.30,0:21:09.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  雇我干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great! For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:12.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带我到那块大石头那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To get me to a little worry-free haven...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.17,0:21:15.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无忧无虑的地方去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}out by that big pointy rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.94,0:21:18.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要我跟你一起去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you want me to come with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.98,0:21:22.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我身边又没有其他  可爱的大疣猪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see any other big lovable chunk of warthog here...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.02,0:21:25.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还刚好长着一双獠牙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who also happens to have razor-sharp tusks...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:27.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能驱赶那些野兽?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the ability to repel predators?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.79,0:21:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的猪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:32.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我  咱俩看法完全一致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and me, I can tell... we see eye to eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.26,0:21:34.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说  像朋友一样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean, like friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.93,0:21:36.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别心急  大个子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, easy there, big fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.63,0:21:40.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说像是...  熟人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say more like... acquaintances.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.74,0:21:43.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  总算是个开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.61,0:21:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,握个手吧  熟人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put 'er there, acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.27,0:21:47.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我是丁满  -彭彭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- l'm Timon. - Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.84,0:21:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.11,0:21:53.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.28,0:21:54.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们上路吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.52,0:21:56.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上路...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.22,0:21:59.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,熟人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.12,0:22:01.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  跟我讲明一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, clear up one thing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.19,0:22:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不吃我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you weren't going to eat me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.86,0:22:05.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你算是哪种古怪的野猪啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what kind of a wacky, wild pig are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.26,0:22:06.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是食虫者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm an insectivore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.93,0:22:09.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃虫子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bug eater.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.76,0:22:11.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.30,0:22:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前不知道还有个专有名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just never had a name for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.17,0:22:15.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢吃爬虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm kind of partial to the crawly critters myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.77,0:22:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你呢  -我有时喜欢吃带翅膀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-How about you, big boy? -l prefer the ones with wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.87,0:22:22.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭  这可能是个  熟人关系的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, this could be the start of a beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.78,0:22:25.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美好开端\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}acquaintanceship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.53,0:22:41.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在回到开头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, so now we're back at the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.60,0:22:42.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧  丁满?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, Timon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.80,0:22:44.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说对啦  朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you got that right, pally.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.30,0:22:49.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,运气终于好起来啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last, things were looking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.60,0:22:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肩上有阳光  脚旁有风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had the sun on my shoulders, the wind at my heels...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.17,0:22:54.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心中有首歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A song in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.55,0:23:05.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一个大胖家伙保护着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to protect me, a great big fat guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.45,0:23:07.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的觉得我很胖?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really think I look fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.66,0:23:09.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, Pumbaa, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.96,0:23:12.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是头猪  这是表扬你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a pig. It's a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.56,0:23:15.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.27,0:23:24.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是生命之轮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the circle of life
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.44,0:23:26.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它环绕着我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it moves us all
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.48,0:23:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是了...  那块大石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is... the big pointy rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.94,0:23:32.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, baby, we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.62,0:23:37.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们来晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we're a little late.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.79,0:23:39.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里人真多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a land rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.29,0:23:41.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个大嘴的猴子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That loudmouth monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.29,0:23:43.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是他告诉了全世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must've blabbed it to the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.66,0:23:45.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他到底说什么啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What exactly did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.23,0:23:48.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越你的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.30,0:23:50.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你的视线该超越这块石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So maybe you're supposed to look beyond the big pointy rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.93,0:23:54.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我该看看大石头的那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe l'm supposed to look beyond the big pointy rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.17,0:23:57.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来看看吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's have a little look, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.54,0:23:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越我的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.77,0:24:02.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越我的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:05.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越我的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.42,0:24:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.12,0:24:11.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只猴子眼光独到  可以去搞房地产了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The monkey's got an eagle eye for real estate!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.79,0:24:12.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.95,0:24:15.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那只猴子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! It's the monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.09,0:24:16.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他举的是什么东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that he's holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.56,0:24:18.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管它呢  不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, who cares? It's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.63,0:24:21.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来呀  我的梦中家园在等着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! My dream home awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.83,0:24:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢很多人在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't do so well in crowds.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.47,0:24:29.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们绕着过去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we better go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.54,0:24:31.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you know the shortest distance...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.24,0:24:32.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和我的梦中家园最短的距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}between me and my dream home...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.91,0:24:35.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一条直线?  跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a straight line? Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.48,0:24:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.68,0:24:39.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.81,0:24:41.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让一让  让一让\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make room, make room!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.88,0:24:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心点  长角的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it, twiggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.78,0:24:45.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm walkin' here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.06,0:25:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  我有话跟你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon! There's something I gotta tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.90,0:25:03.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, Pumbaa, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.10,0:25:06.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我们安排妥当后  自然有足够时间聊天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have plenty of time to chat once we settle in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.78,0:25:09.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的想休息一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could really use a rest stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.01,0:25:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别急  你有机会休息的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. You'll get your second wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.58,0:25:16.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有点不舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a really bad feeling!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.48,0:25:17.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.59,0:25:19.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  会好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me. lt'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.46,0:25:30.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看  犀牛在鞠躬呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, look, the rhinos are bowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.56,0:25:32.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们最好也鞠躬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd better bow, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.51,0:25:46.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  陛下  大家都向王子跪拜表达敬意呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, sire, how they kneel before the royal son.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.56,0:25:56.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你的特异功能?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I guess that's your special power, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.89,0:25:58.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真猛啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.63,0:26:00.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说  你不在意?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean, you don't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.06,0:26:02.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开玩笑?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.83,0:26:05.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是放屁嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.67,0:26:08.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢炫耀自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I don't like to toot my own horn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.77,0:26:10.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样最好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's probably for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.87,0:26:13.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭  我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, Pumbaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.24,0:26:15.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来带路吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.29,0:26:26.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了  朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it, buddy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.39,0:26:28.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家  温馨的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home, sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.39,0:26:30.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想和任何人分享\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't gotta share it with anybody. Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.89,0:26:33.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不感到孤独吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you get, you know, lonely out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.59,0:26:36.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孤独?  我会感到无忧无虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lonely? Try commitment-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.10,0:26:38.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挤来挤去的  让我感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The elbow-to-elbow life reminds me...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.37,0:26:39.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到了以前的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a little too much of home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.83,0:26:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方什么都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place has everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.67,0:26:44.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,清爽的饮料  舒适的小吊床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cool refreshments, cozy little hammock...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.27,0:26:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可爱的水流  这些全都属于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a lovely water feature, and it's all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.41,0:26:55.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的梦想实现了  丁满...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's really coming together, Timon, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.28,0:26:58.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so, I guess I'll just be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.02,0:27:05.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute, now. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.46,0:27:08.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有规定说你一定要走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no law that says you have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.30,0:27:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  如果你想...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, if you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.50,0:27:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  我已经铺好了两张床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great! I already made up two beds!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.03,0:27:15.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一张是你的  一张是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One for you, and one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.35,0:27:28.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些整理工作把我累坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gee, all this construction work has me bushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.35,0:27:30.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要早睡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think l'll turn in early.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.31,0:27:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.58,0:27:56.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睡个好觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.84,0:27:59.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝今晚梦见臭虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dream of bedbugs tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.22,0:28:08.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家  温馨的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home, sweet home indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.05,0:28:34.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  小声一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, keep it down up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.45,0:28:36.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有邻居吗  我们该去打个招呼才对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have neighbors? We should go say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.02,0:28:38.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵闹的邻居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noisy neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.28,0:28:40.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下房子不值钱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There go the property values.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.52,0:28:45.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地上走的  天上飞的  大家都来听啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's hear it in the herd and on the wing
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.26,0:28:50.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这将是国王辛巴的一件美事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be King Simba's finest fling
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.30,0:28:54.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真等不及想当国王了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I just can't wait to be king
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.10,0:28:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  我们到了戏剧街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect. We moved to the theater district.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.97,0:28:58.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧这帮家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a load of these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.81,0:29:00.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.98,0:29:04.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等不及想...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just can't wait
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.21,0:29:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.28,0:29:09.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be king
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.69,0:29:15.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.66,0:29:19.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艺人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.36,0:29:20.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打起精神  彭彭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chin up, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.93,0:29:24.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的梦中家园就在附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our dream home's around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.43,0:29:26.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到过一个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Timon, I once came across a place...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.90,0:29:29.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可能就是你要找的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that might be just what you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.14,0:29:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,壮观的瀑布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spectacular waterfalls...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.10,0:29:33.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在一个沙漠绿洲里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}set in a lush tropical oasis...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.67,0:29:34.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一排排...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a scrumptious array of...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.84,0:29:36.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey. Forget it, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.28,0:29:39.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是现实主义者  不喜欢追逐幻想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a realist, and l'm not gonna go chasing after some fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.85,0:29:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要超越我的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going beyond what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.08,0:29:44.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你总是超越视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you always go beyond what you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.45,0:29:45.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道你到了呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how do you know when you're there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.79,0:29:47.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, l'll tell you how I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.75,0:29:49.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're there!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.33,0:29:56.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这块地方不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a lovely spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.76,0:29:58.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乡村式的独特风景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lovely, rustic, picturesque.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.73,0:30:00.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家  温馨的家  彭彭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home sweet home, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.87,0:30:02.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家  温馨的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home sweet ho...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.77,0:30:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要修整一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, sure, it needs a little work...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.88,0:30:12.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但结构还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's got good bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.11,0:30:16.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是大象墓园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all, this is an elephant graveyard...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.22,0:30:19.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会到大象墓园来呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and who would ever come to an elephant graveyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.45,0:30:23.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陛下  土狼在追孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sire, the hyenas are after the children!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.83,0:30:29.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到食肉动物了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see carnivores.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.03,0:30:31.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越你的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.63,0:30:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越你的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.17,0:30:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越你的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond what you see!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.47,0:30:37.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我现在跟你提\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon? Would this be a bad time...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.84,0:30:39.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去过的那地方你会介意吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to bring up that little place I told you about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.74,0:30:42.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是家  温馨的家  宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! This is home sweet home, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.91,0:30:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.51,0:30:48.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蒸气  蒸气好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steam! Steam is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.51,0:30:52.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蒸气是...  水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steam is water. Gotta have water.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.52,0:30:54.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梦想之家就应该有水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, for the dream home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.19,0:30:55.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蒸气的家  梦想之家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steam home, dream home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.35,0:30:57.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蒸气  蒸气  蒸气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steam, steam, steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.42,0:31:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里很幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am perfectly happy right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.19,0:31:03.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里很偏僻  隐蔽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's remote, private...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.53,0:31:05.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有不速之客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no unexpected visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.50,0:31:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somethin' tells me this ain't...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.17,0:31:15.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱尔兰大河之舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the traveling company of ''Riverdance.''
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.58,0:31:23.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越你的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.42,0:31:25.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越你的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond what you...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.38,0:31:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样我怎么超越我的视线  看个屁啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, how am I supposed to look beyond what I see beyond that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.32,0:31:33.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.00,0:31:42.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方缺少水和遮蔽物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What this place lacks in water and shade...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.40,0:31:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却有酷热和烈日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it makes up for with searing heat and blinding sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.70,0:31:47.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家  甜蜜家园  彭彭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home sweet home, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.55,0:31:56.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们逃命吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall we run for our lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.98,0:31:58.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  快跑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes, let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.57,0:32:18.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住  丁满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, Timon!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.30,0:32:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就对啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.07,0:32:22.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见  残酷的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good-bye, cruel world!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.55,0:32:34.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.89,0:32:37.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不算太差嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wasn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.12,0:32:40.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满不会那么容易被打垮的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't knock old Timon down that easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.39,0:32:42.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来  出招吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.36,0:32:46.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.00,0:32:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Question...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.37,0:32:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有没有可能  从地球边上掉下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is it possible to fall off the edge of the earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.34,0:32:53.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从技术上讲不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Technically, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.11,0:32:55.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为地球是圆的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The earth is round like a sphere, Timon...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.41,0:32:57.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so it doesn't actually have an edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.29,0:33:08.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以暂停一下吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mind if I pause it for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.22,0:33:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  随你便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.32,0:33:10.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.87,0:33:27.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界真是小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a small world after all
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.34,0:33:30.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界真是小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a small world after all
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.94,0:33:33.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个小小的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a small, small world
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.38,0:33:34.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家一起唱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.75,0:33:37.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界真是小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a small world after all
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.76,0:33:50.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我买了大盒的  我们可以分享\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, I got the jumbo so we could share.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.16,0:33:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才在挖鼻孔吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you just picking your nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.00,0:33:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才在挖鼻孔吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you just picking your nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.97,0:33:56.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  是里面有点痒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I had an itch on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.43,0:34:28.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon, you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.30,0:34:30.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.54,0:34:32.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.30,0:34:34.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还没找到梦想之家呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We still haven't found our dream home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.37,0:34:36.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了吧  彭彭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget it, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.61,0:34:39.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拖着你乱跑已经够久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been dragging you down long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.58,0:34:43.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要回家  我建议你也回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going home, and I suggest you do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.45,0:34:47.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能回家我早就回了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would if I could, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.95,0:34:50.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当然可以回家  朋友  我不会阻拦你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure you can, buddy. I won't stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.89,0:34:52.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.12,0:34:53.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.73,0:34:56.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有家?  怎么啦?  你迷路啦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't? What happened? Are you lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.83,0:34:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有你喜欢的地方?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No place good enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.13,0:35:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你孤零零的  活在这个空荡荡的世界上?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you're all alone in this big empty world?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.45,0:35:17.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.65,0:35:21.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是孤独一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm all alone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.92,0:35:29.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭  你是我唯一的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, you're the only friend I've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.26,0:35:31.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.33,0:35:34.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  彭彭  而朋友要永远在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Pumbaa... and friends stick together to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.58,0:35:50.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  你哭啦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon, are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.48,0:35:53.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.75,0:35:57.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是眼里进了东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just have something in my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.02,0:35:59.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来  擤一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.29,0:36:05.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿去  彭彭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.33,0:36:07.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真多谢啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gee, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.23,0:36:09.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  我好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, l'm better.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.76,0:36:37.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.96,0:36:40.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有找到  那个完美的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too bad we never found that perfect place.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.50,0:36:42.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们为何要听笨猴子的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd we ever listen to that stupid monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.60,0:36:46.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你太早放弃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think maybe you're giving up too soon, Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.94,0:36:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越你的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.94,0:36:54.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得我跟你提到的那个地方吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember that place I told you about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.65,0:36:56.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别提你那个地方了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget about your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.38,0:36:58.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看我找到的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a load of what I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.35,0:37:02.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说到"超越我的视线"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk about beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.12,0:37:05.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我们的梦想之家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, this is our dream home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.09,0:37:07.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生动的景色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dramatic views.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.13,0:37:10.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己的吊床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your very own porch swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.89,0:37:12.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水疗和三温暖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hot tub and spa.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.56,0:37:13.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,取之不尽的食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well stocked cupboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.40,0:37:17.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们庆祝一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.63,0:37:19.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个猴子是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The monkey was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.74,0:37:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到了...  完美的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found it... the perfect life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.97,0:37:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去搞点吃的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll just whip up a little something.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.31,0:37:28.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他起的名字也最完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had the perfect name for it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.81,0:37:30.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come and get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.75,0:37:33.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常漂亮的词语  还有独特的韵律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a wonderful phrase. It had this rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.48,0:37:35.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[节拍]\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laduda.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.29,0:37:37.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尝尝这个...  热鲔鱼蛋饼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try this... hot tuna frittata.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.82,0:37:38.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.99,0:37:40.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菠菜阿玛达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The spinach armada.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.32,0:37:42.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安静  我在想呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet, Pumbaa. I'm trying to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.13,0:37:43.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一勺干酪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A spoon of ricotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.29,0:37:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-两个字  -一份牛肉片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-Two words. -A wormy piccata.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.80,0:37:48.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有六个音节  -行家的克喇塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-Si syllables. -Kahuna colada.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.43,0:37:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-十二个字母  -蓝色的安奇拉塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-Twelve letters. -A blue enchilada.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.47,0:37:51.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,押韵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rhymes with...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.50,0:37:53.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,豆子一盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legumes on a platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.34,0:37:54.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个可辣呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ought to be hotter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.34,0:37:57.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我忘了  -我要跳粘巴达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I forget. - I got to lambada!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.34,0:38:00.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有心情跳舞?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, how can you dance at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.31,0:38:02.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都快要想破头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm dying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.31,0:38:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about that, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.68,0:38:06.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna Matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.35,0:38:08.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说一遍?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.69,0:38:11.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈库拉马塔塔  就是无忧无虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna matata... it means ''No worries.''
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.46,0:38:21.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我有个主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Timon, I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.93,0:38:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来唱卡拉OK\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do a sing-along.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.47,0:38:25.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you tease.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.40,0:38:28.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢卡拉OK  我来唱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love karaoke. l'm there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.60,0:38:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna Matata
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.27,0:38:34.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多么美妙的词语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a wonderful phrase
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.28,0:38:36.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna Matata
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.44,0:38:39.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是一时流行的词语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't no passin' craze
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.95,0:38:42.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是无忧无虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means no worries
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.28,0:38:44.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从今往后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the rest of your days
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.42,0:38:47.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.36,0:38:49.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭  那虫子跑哪里去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, where's the grub?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.13,0:38:56.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是控制不住自己?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just can't help yourself, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.43,0:38:57.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.57,0:39:01.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这回要控制一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, but this time, show a little self-control.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.64,0:39:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna Matata
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.85,0:39:16.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是无忧无虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means no worries
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.22,0:39:19.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从今往后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the rest of your days
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.72,0:39:22.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有任何烦恼的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's our problem free
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.02,0:39:25.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哲学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Philosophy
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.36,0:39:26.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna Matata
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.83,0:39:28.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马塔塔  哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Matata Hakuna Matata
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.17,0:39:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hahuna Ma...  什么啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hahuna ma-what-a?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.74,0:39:41.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是无忧无虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means ''No worries.''
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.51,0:39:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.98,0:39:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是  我就告诉那小子  去找哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I told the boy to find hakuna matata...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.12,0:39:49.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要超越自己的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you must look beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.92,0:39:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个比喻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, a metaphor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.52,0:39:55.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上  那不是个...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, actually, it's not a meta...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.26,0:39:57.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给丁满打比喻?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You used a metaphor on Timon?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.03,0:40:00.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他对什么都很认真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He takes things literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.50,0:40:02.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在外边一定挨饿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. He's starving out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.53,0:40:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.97,0:40:07.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦斯  丁满在外面找比喻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Max, Timon's out there chasing metaphors.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.14,0:40:08.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得把他找回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to go find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.70,0:40:10.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你疯啦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.10,0:40:12.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有家庭的支持真好  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to have a supportive family, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.74,0:40:14.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  我走啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.54,0:40:17.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记住  千里之行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, the journey of a thousand miles...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.35,0:40:19.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,始于足下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}begins with the first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.28,0:40:22.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  我这就迈出第一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. Here's my first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.06,0:40:31.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来拿豪猪打保龄球  不是什么好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This bowling for porcupines wasn't the best idea, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.63,0:40:33.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  这就跟拿屁股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Got to be right up there...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.36,0:40:35.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钓鳄鱼一样糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with bobbing for snapping turtles.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.30,0:40:38.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定会留下疤痕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's going to leave a mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.97,0:40:42.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  看  秃鹰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look, Timon, buzzards.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.14,0:40:43.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们再来玩一轮  怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say, one more round?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.71,0:40:45.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行啊  我身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, sure. There must be some part of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.41,0:40:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定还有没伤过的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we haven't injured yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.98,0:40:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, please? Oh, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.08,0:40:51.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我累了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, Pumbaa, l'm beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.51,0:40:53.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你玩吧  我要回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go ahead. I'm calling it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.48,0:40:56.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是一个人玩没意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's no fun alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.26,0:41:04.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有何不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.83,0:41:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多玩一轮不会改变我们的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more run won't change our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.03,0:41:13.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道那天命运是怎么把我们引到辛巴的面前的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knows why fate led us to little Simba that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.70,0:41:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是因为我喜欢冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it was just my love of adventure...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.60,0:41:17.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者是我内在的勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or my innate courage...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.87,0:41:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我大无畏的精神...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my valiant and fearless way of...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.48,0:41:23.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  是谁负责控制这些定格画面的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, who's in charge of the freeze frames?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.28,0:41:24.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.55,0:41:26.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anywho...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.38,0:41:28.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,营救辛巴不费吹灰之力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rescuing Simba was a cinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.72,0:41:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来才是可怕的部份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then came the really scary part...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.02,0:41:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当父母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}parenthood.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.46,0:41:38.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 在丛林中，巨大的丛林 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ In the jungle, the mighty jungle ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.96,0:41:42.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 狮子今晚已经熟睡 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ The lion sleeps tonight ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.66,0:41:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 在丛林中，巨大的丛林 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ In the jungle, the mighty jungle ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.50,0:41:46.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 在丛林中，巨大的丛林 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ In the jungle, the mighty jungle ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.20,0:41:48.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  丁满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon. Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.64,0:41:49.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.31,0:41:52.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我要去  -去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- l got to go. - Go?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.04,0:41:54.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go where?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.24,0:41:56.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去...  尿尿啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, go... bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.68,0:41:59.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么不早说?  好  我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, go? Why didn't you say so? Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.38,0:42:01.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该去时就得去啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you got to go, you got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.98,0:42:04.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小狮子  下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young lion, get down from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.99,0:42:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好耶  从上面看起来你们像蚂蚁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right! Man, you guys look like ants down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.49,0:42:11.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我数三下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm counting to three.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.73,0:42:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一  二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.24,0:42:22.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.20,0:42:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 在丛林中，巨大的丛林 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ In the jungle, the mighty jungle ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.87,0:42:25.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.44,0:42:26.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又要去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.54,0:42:28.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我渴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. l'm thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.44,0:42:29.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这意味着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know this means you'll be up again...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.98,0:42:31.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再过两个小时你又要去尿啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about two hours from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.05,0:42:33.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 丛林布吉乐 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Jungle boogie ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.05,0:42:36.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 丛林布吉乐，兴奋起来 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Jungle boogie, get it on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.45,0:42:38.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撑着点  辛巴  我来救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, Simba! I'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.73,0:42:46.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.23,0:42:47.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 巨大的丛林 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ The mighty jungle... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.46,0:42:50.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这样走下去会变老的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to get old walking across this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.47,0:42:54.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 在丛林中，巨大的... ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ In the jungle, the might... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.07,0:42:56.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.94,0:42:58.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么就是不愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you got against the concept...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.84,0:43:01.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好睡一觉呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a good night's sleep, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.24,0:43:04.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实  我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, l...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.11,0:43:05.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做了个噩梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.75,0:43:09.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊  这样啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.18,0:43:11.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.25,0:43:13.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小子做了个噩梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Junior had a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.26,0:43:18.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你过来和我们一起来睡吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you sleep over here with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.99,0:43:21.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的彭彭  就是你的彭彭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mi Pumbaa, su Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.43,0:43:22.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.83,0:43:25.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 狮子今晚已经熟睡 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ The lion sleeps tonight ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.00,0:43:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.00,0:43:28.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.17,0:43:30.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你今晚梦见臭虫...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dream of bedbugs tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.68,0:44:10.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 我的小亲亲 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ My little darling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.68,0:44:13.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 不要害怕，我的小亲亲 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Don't fear, my little darling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.51,0:44:16.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 嘿哈，我的小亲亲 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Hey-a, oh, my little darling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.88,0:44:20.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 不要害怕，我的小亲亲 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Oh, don't fear, my little darling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.53,0:44:31.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 不要害怕，我的小亲亲 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Don't fear, my little darling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.30,0:44:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 嘿哈，我的小亲亲 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Hey-a, oh, my little darling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.18,0:44:51.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你早上起床打哈欠的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch where you aim that morning breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.72,0:44:53.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,提醒我们躲开你张嘴的方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That should come with a warning label.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.52,0:44:56.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真的会臭醒人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoo, what a wake-up call.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.12,0:44:59.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来有人有起床气喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like someone woke up on the wrong side of the warthog.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.66,0:45:00.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦  老爹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter, pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.86,0:45:02.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈库拉马塔塔  没用啦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had a little too much hakuna matata?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.83,0:45:06.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小子  哈库拉马塔塔  是我发明的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonny boy, I invented hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.00,0:45:09.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  那是我改良了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah? Well, I perfected it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.60,0:45:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure you did, sure you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.87,0:45:16.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭  谁保持吃虫子后  打饱嗝最长的记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, who holds the record for the world's longest bug belch?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.54,0:45:18.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那应该是辛巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.38,0:45:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All righty, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.98,0:45:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁是吃鼻涕虫的冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's the champion at slug swallowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.38,0:45:23.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是辛巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.38,0:45:25.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-嚼蟋蟀呢  -辛巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cricket crunching? - Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.22,0:45:26.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-吞虫虫呢  -辛巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Grub gulping? -Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.29,0:45:27.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-吃蛆呢  -还是辛巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maggot munching? - Still Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.62,0:45:28.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃蜗牛呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snail slurping?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.79,0:45:33.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人是冠军  我们还没比过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody. We never had a snail eating contest before.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.07,0:45:50.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这不是什么好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think this is such a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.26,0:46:43.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早说过这不是个好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you this wasn't such a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.65,0:47:08.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这比赛证明了青出于蓝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thus did the pupil surpass the teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.42,0:47:10.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又跟那猴子一起混啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been hanging around with the monkey again, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.03,0:47:22.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的辛巴长大啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Simba is growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.61,0:47:32.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我以前  抱过的那个小家伙?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ls this the little boy I carried?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.91,0:47:38.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候他长得这么高了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did he grow to be so tall?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.15,0:47:41.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好像还是昨天的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wasn't it yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.65,0:47:48.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还是小小的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he was small?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.96,0:47:51.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日出  日落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sunrise, sunset
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.53,0:47:54.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日出  日落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sunrise, sunset
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.70,0:47:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时光匆匆飞逝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swiftly fly the years
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.50,0:48:00.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时光匆匆飞逝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swiftly fly the years
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.41,0:48:07.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个季节接着一个季节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One season following another
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.18,0:48:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满了幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laden with happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.55,0:48:15.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和泪水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And tears
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.09,0:48:20.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是它们叫粪金龟的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you see, that's why they call it a dung beetle.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.13,0:48:21.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见得吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.86,0:48:23.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还挺好吃的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet still so tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.43,0:48:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也是我的最爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, and they're my favorite, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.54,0:48:38.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟医生讲的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just what the doctor ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.88,0:48:41.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无所事事一天后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep. After a long day of doing nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.88,0:48:44.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休息一下真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's good to kick back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.15,0:48:46.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三个朋友一起无忧无虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three pals and no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.55,0:48:49.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还能要求什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What more could you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.26,0:49:02.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我累了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm bushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.13,0:49:05.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去睡觉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think l'll turn in for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.31,0:49:13.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.95,0:49:16.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.32,0:49:21.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们折磨死我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.26,0:49:27.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  轮到你说晚安了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon, it's your turn to say good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.76,0:49:28.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.93,0:49:30.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.50,0:49:32.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝今晚梦见臭虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dream of bedbugs tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.86,0:49:59.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to admit...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.52,0:50:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在那里过得不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we had a pretty good thing going there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.93,0:50:04.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们本来可以一直过下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could've gone on like that forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.93,0:50:08.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是我们忽略了一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for one teeny weeny little thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.20,0:50:09.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很小很小的细节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we forgot to count on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.40,0:50:15.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娜娜?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nala?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.24,0:50:18.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你怎么...  -你怎么...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-How did you... -How did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.44,0:50:19.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个灾难  彭彭...  我告诉你  这是个灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a disaster, Pumbaa... a disaster, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.48,0:50:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个灾难  彭彭...  我告诉你  这是个灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a disaster, Pumbaa... a disaster, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.08,0:50:24.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说他们好像是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean because they've finally found each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.52,0:50:27.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寻找真爱多年...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like two soul mates joined across the years...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.19,0:50:28.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于再度重逢的情人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the bonds of true love?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.92,0:50:30.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天真无邪的小彭彭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweet, innocent little Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.96,0:50:33.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会毁了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's going to put a stake right through the heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.12,0:50:34.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈库拉马塔塔的生活方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of our hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.56,0:50:38.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们应该要采取行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I guess we ought to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.10,0:50:40.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道该怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know just what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.53,0:50:45.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭  今晚无论如何  都不能让他们感觉到爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, we can't let them feel the love tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.42,0:51:11.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你今晚能感受到这份爱吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you feel the love tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.88,0:51:35.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你今晚能感受到这份爱吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you feel the love tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.89,0:51:38.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真浪漫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's so romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.47,0:51:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚你能感受到...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you feel the love...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.03,0:52:21.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚你能感受到这份爱吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you feel the love tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.80,0:52:27.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安详静谧的夜晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The peace the evening brings?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.17,0:52:32.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这招真灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that worked like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.91,0:52:34.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It did?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.21,0:52:37.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听不懂这是一种讽刺吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarcasm is a foreign language to you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.41,0:52:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.45,0:52:42.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能否感受到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you feel the love...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.52,0:52:44.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在抛媚眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's making those eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.32,0:52:47.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他对她笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's smiling that smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.12,0:52:48.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在笑...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're laughing...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.93,0:52:51.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在拥抱...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and hugging...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.09,0:52:53.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.03,0:53:00.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他今晚坠入爱河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if he falls in love tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.37,0:53:08.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那一切就结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can be assumed
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.35,0:53:10.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和我们的自由日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His carefree days
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.91,0:53:14.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也完蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With us are history
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.32,0:53:25.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简单说  我们的朋友就报销了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ln short, our pal is doomed
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.06,0:53:55.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算啦  哥儿们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.63,0:53:58.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们竭尽了全力  但是还是失去了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gave it our best shot, but he's a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.63,0:54:02.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不一定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.50,0:54:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从不放弃  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never give up, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.67,0:54:06.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.27,0:54:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你甚至不知道我经厉过什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't even know what l've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.27,0:54:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-如果你告诉我  我就知道了  -算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- l would if you'd ust tell me. - Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.37,0:54:11.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.58,0:54:17.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭  你知道这意味着什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, do you know what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.21,0:54:20.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没办法表达感情  而她对他还有疑虑?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can't express his feelings and she has commitment issues?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.52,0:54:24.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们赢了  把他们拆散了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won. We split them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.22,0:54:27.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是件好事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.73,0:54:34.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来他受到的打击不小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He seems to be taking it kind of hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.56,0:54:36.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  可怜的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know. Look, l...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.73,0:54:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可对我们来说是好事...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's the best thing for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.53,0:54:41.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  对他  我们走吧  彭彭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean for him. Let's go, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.40,0:54:43.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得暴风雨要来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think this storm's coming to a head.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.21,0:54:49.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈库拉马塔塔安全啦  哥儿们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna matata is safe at last, pal...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.58,0:54:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为不论什么事  都无法带走我们的小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because nothing's going to take our boy away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.95,0:54:55.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他走了?  你说什么  他走了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone? What do you mean, he's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.75,0:54:57.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像那只狒狒说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just like the baboon said.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.99,0:55:00.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国王已经回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The king has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.83,0:55:08.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要我再说一遍吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to go over it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.83,0:55:10.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  不过请你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, please, but be a dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.40,0:55:12.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接跳到辛巴那段...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and just skip to the part about Simba...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.33,0:55:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是嫌你童年不有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not that your childhood wasn't fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.17,0:55:17.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  听着  辛巴才是国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, look, Simba's the rightful king...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.64,0:55:19.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是他失踪以后...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but after he disappeared...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.14,0:55:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀疤自封为王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scar proclaimed himself the king...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.78,0:55:22.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和土狼结成了联盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and formed an alliance with the hyenas.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.61,0:55:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的辛巴  那个卖国贼  背信忘义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor Simba... the treachery, the villainy...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.28,0:55:28.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卑鄙下流  真是丢脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the sheer indescribable horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.45,0:55:31.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她为什么要逗我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blah, blah, blah. Why is she toying with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.75,0:55:33.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个母老虎想吃掉我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This crazy chick is going to eat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.79,0:55:36.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛巴一定要回家  向他的叔叔挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba has to go home to challenge his uncle...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.22,0:55:38.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重新夺回属于他的王位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and reclaim his rightful place as king.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.03,0:55:45.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还不明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.63,0:55:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛巴需要我们...  就是现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba needs us... now!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.97,0:55:51.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他需要我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs us?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.61,0:55:53.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他就不该离开我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then he shouldn't have left us!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.44,0:55:56.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他要回去  做他的"陛下"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf he wants to run off to be ''His Highness''...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.21,0:55:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我会说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well, I say 
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.40,0:56:00.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"越快走越好"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't let the branches hit you on the way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.45,0:56:03.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把哈库拉马塔塔留给真正欣赏它的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave hakuna matata to someone who appreciates it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.89,0:56:08.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是  丁满  没有辛巴  就不哈库拉马塔塔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, Timon, it's not really hakuna matata without Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.16,0:56:10.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么啦  不哈库拉马塔塔?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's gotten into you? Not hakuna matata?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.46,0:56:13.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直是疯话  我告诉你  这是疯话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's crazy talk... crazy talk, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.26,0:56:14.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里一切都没有变...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing's changed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.76,0:56:16.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛巴来以前  我们也一样哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had hakuna matata before Simba...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.97,0:56:18.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们依然哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we've still got it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.07,0:56:21.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  我们该去帮助  我们的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to go help our friend, Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.40,0:56:23.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭  你也是?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Et tu, Pumbaa?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.44,0:56:26.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算就这样离开  放弃这一切?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just going to walk away, give up on all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.64,0:56:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还说什么朋友要永远在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to ''friends stick together to the end''?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.25,0:56:34.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正打算问你相同的问题呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was about to ask you the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.42,0:56:45.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我所需要的一切都在这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got everything I ever wanted right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.91,0:57:08.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还比较像样点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, this is more like it...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.72,0:57:10.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多的是空间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}elbow room.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.57,0:57:27.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, boy, oh, boy, oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.48,0:57:40.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna Matata
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.42,0:57:44.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多么美妙的词语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a wonderful phrase
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.49,0:57:47.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna Matata
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.22,0:57:53.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是一时流行的词语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't no passing craze
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.00,0:57:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.53,0:58:00.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无忧无虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.10,0:58:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你  不要  什么也别说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You. No, no. Don't say a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.51,0:58:07.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你要说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you're going to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.21,0:58:09.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找到哈库拉马塔塔了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you find hakuna matata?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.54,0:58:11.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.75,0:58:13.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.18,0:58:15.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I am happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.08,0:58:18.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy, happy, deliriously happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.15,0:58:22.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂了  幸福  是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see. Happy, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.52,0:58:25.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你真的幸福  为什么看起来很痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, if you're so happy, why do you look so miserable?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.16,0:58:26.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说我痛苦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miserable, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.53,0:58:27.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should I be miserable?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.80,0:58:30.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  也许是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I don't know. Maybe my two best pals...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.30,0:58:31.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我两个最好的朋友抛弃了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the world deserted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.87,0:58:37.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要去做英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heh. They've headed off on some heroic mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.11,0:58:40.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的朋友都走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friends are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.18,0:58:49.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的哈库拉马塔塔也跟他们一起走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my hakuna matata went with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.55,0:58:53.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.26,0:58:57.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  我很高兴我们聊开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. l'm glad we had this talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.16,0:59:03.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里的工作结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My work here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.30,0:59:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朋友要永远在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friends stick together to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.72,0:59:58.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么那样跑啊  那样也算是跑吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was with the running? lf you can call that running.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.39,1:00:00.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这是为了让你能赶上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was giving you time to catch up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.59,1:00:05.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个大笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, you big lug.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.26,1:00:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上来吧  朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hop on, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.73,1:00:09.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有场仗在等着打呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a fight to catch.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.73,1:00:12.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们冲过草原吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's whip some grass.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.57,1:00:16.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就是传奇的所在  有壮烈的战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the stuff of legends... an epic struggle...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.04,1:00:19.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是英雄诞生之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the place where heroes are born.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.91,1:00:24.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭  这可能  是我们最难忘的时刻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, this could be our finest hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.21,1:00:25.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烤野猪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luau!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.91,1:00:27.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想吃美味多汁的猪肉吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf you're hungry for a hunk of fat and uicy meat
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.55,1:00:29.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃我朋友彭彭  因为他...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat my buddy Pumbaa here because he...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.12,1:00:31.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们直接开始追逐吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just cut to the chase, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.79,1:00:33.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.66,1:00:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.01,1:00:56.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最爱彭彭早上的味道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love the smell of Pumbaa in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.28,1:00:59.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猪头  移开你的屁股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, move your tush, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.95,1:01:01.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈?  麦斯叔叔?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma? Uncle Max?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.45,1:01:03.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-啊  丁满  -丁满?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, Timmy! - Timon?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.85,1:01:05.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在这里做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.62,1:01:10.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找你啊  妈咪来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking for you. Aw. Mommy's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.66,1:01:13.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我来介绍一下  我最好的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let me introduce you to my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.69,1:01:15.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭  我妈妈  麦斯叔叔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, Ma, Uncle Max.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.60,1:01:18.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  麦斯叔叔  彭彭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma, Uncle Max, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.17,1:01:21.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  是辛巴  那一定是他的叔叔刀疤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, there's Simba, and that must be his uncle Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.94,1:01:23.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  他们谈和了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, good, they're talking things out...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.90,1:01:25.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情就该这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is how it should be.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.44,1:01:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I have a feeling...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.01,1:01:28.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything's going to be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.21,1:01:32.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是话说回来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.11,1:01:34.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,土狼在上面保护刀疤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the hyenas are up there protecting Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.61,1:01:36.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该怎么办呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.15,1:01:37.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我有个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, l've got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.65,1:01:39.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能帮什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can we help?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.62,1:01:41.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  麦斯叔叔  你们挖个陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma, Uncle Max, you're going to dig a trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.89,1:01:43.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to need...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.72,1:01:45.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dare I say it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.33,1:01:48.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地道  很多很多的地道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tunnels... lots and lots of tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.76,1:01:50.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭  你和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, Pumbaa, you and me...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.40,1:01:52.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定要把土狼从辛巴那里引走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we've got to get those hyenas away from Simba.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.23,1:01:54.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他们引入陷阱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And lure them into the trap?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.33,1:01:56.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都瞒不过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing gets past you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.78,1:01:59.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭  来  我们上吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Pumbaa, Let's ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.11,1:02:06.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满和往常有点不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's different about Timon.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.18,1:02:09.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也觉得?  他穿了条裙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think? He's wearing a dress!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.66,1:02:21.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  彭彭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.79,1:02:24.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个只有有半个脑袋的土狼  叫什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you call a hyena with half a brain?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.53,1:02:27.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  丁满  叫什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beats me, Timon. What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.70,1:02:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,土蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gifted.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.14,1:02:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在说我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're talking about us.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.57,1:02:37.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们死前  绝对会后悔讲这些话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For your last meal, you're going to eat those words.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.68,1:02:46.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  我想我们已经引起他们的注意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma, I think we got their attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.82,1:02:50.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没有  继续拖住他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet. Keep stalling.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.49,1:02:52.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.49,1:02:55.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.83,1:03:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了吗  妈妈?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Ma?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.37,1:03:01.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还需要点时间  宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Need more time, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.97,1:03:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自由式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freestyle.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.18,1:03:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来  再来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Encore, encore.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.28,1:03:17.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你是说"开胃菜"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. You mean entree, entree.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.75,1:03:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  直接把他们吃掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you right. Let's just eat them.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.42,1:03:21.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了吗  妈妈?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ls it ready yet, Ma?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.59,1:03:23.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没有  继续拖延\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet. Keep stalling.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.00,1:03:32.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait, wait, wait. Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.60,1:03:35.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.33,1:03:39.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非洲大草原肉食动物之土狼  桑琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shenzi Marie Predatora Veldetta Jacquelina Hyena...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.04,1:03:44.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是否有荣幸娶你  做我的新娘?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would you do me the honor of becoming my bride?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.11,1:03:49.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.58,1:03:52.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桑琪  拜托  我知道你的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shenzi Marie, please. I know what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.35,1:03:54.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们差异太大  不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're too different. It'll never work.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.39,1:03:56.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想孩子会长成什么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will the children look like?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.52,1:03:59.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这会打破很多  自然法则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That violates so many laws of nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.69,1:04:02.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  像我们这种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me. The problems of a couple of wacky kids...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.60,1:04:04.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,配对生下来的不正常孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like us don't amount to a hill of termites...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.70,1:04:06.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这个疯狂的世界里  根本不是什么问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in this nutty circle of life thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.53,1:04:10.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我问你  现在不结几时结?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so I ask you... if not now, when?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.50,1:04:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你如果不要我  要谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf not me, who?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.37,1:04:15.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好孤独\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm lonely.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.31,1:04:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能做你的伴郎吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I be your best man?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.38,1:04:21.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说  我们跳过婚礼  直接吃喜酒吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say we skip the wedding and go straight to the buffet.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.65,1:04:22.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.65,1:04:24.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然啦  你准备好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, if you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.88,1:04:26.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  麦斯  现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Max, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.42,1:04:28.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,土狼进洞啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hyenas in the hole!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.07,1:04:43.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来帮我  我弄不成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need help. It didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.94,1:04:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这里行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it works for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.84,1:04:50.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.35,1:04:59.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.62,1:05:00.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.06,1:05:07.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们吃了他们吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.92,1:05:33.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,依我看刀疤完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say Scar is down and out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.99,1:05:35.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did it! We did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.65,1:05:37.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满在哪里  我的宝贝呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Timon? Where's my baby?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.89,1:05:41.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他受伤了  啊  不  他死了  或者更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's hurt! Oh, no! He's dead! Or worse!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.06,1:05:44.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to find him. We've got to find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.36,1:05:45.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's OK, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.43,1:05:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要说没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, please. lt is not OK!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.97,1:05:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跟我说没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you tell me it's OK!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.10,1:05:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timmy!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.68,1:05:59.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的儿子...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My son...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.35,1:06:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.62,1:06:07.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你漏了一处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You missed a spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.43,1:06:15.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真棒啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.56,1:06:17.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,憋死啦  不能呼吸啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Choking. Not breathing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.29,1:06:47.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有你们我是无法成功的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't have done it without you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.00,1:07:00.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的好小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's our boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.57,1:07:04.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发过誓绝对不哭的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promised myself I wasn't going to cry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.70,1:07:31.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  你真的长大了很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've really come a long way, Timon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.94,1:07:34.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找到你要找的地方了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you find what you were looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.04,1:07:39.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到了一个梦寐以求的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found a place that was beyond my wildest dreams...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.51,1:07:41.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是那里还不算是家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it still wasn't home.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.71,1:07:44.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  我们回家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go home, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.59,1:07:54.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回到我们的新家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to our new home...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.66,1:07:56.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里没有会吃我们的野兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a predator-free environment.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.39,1:08:00.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满  我真的要称赞你  这里什么都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to hand it to you, Timon. This place has everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.90,1:08:03.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们团聚了  这才算家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now that we're all here, it does.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.25,1:08:16.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鹤...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crane...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.91,1:08:22.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,展开翅膀  然后优雅的转身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}spreads its wings, turns with dainty hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.49,1:08:24.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挖个地道  挖呀挖  挖个地道  挖呀挖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Digga tunnah, dig, digga tunnah
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.82,1:08:27.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们再也不用挖地洞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're never gonna dig another tunnah
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.16,1:08:29.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挖个地道  挖呀挖  挖个地道  挖呀挖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Digga tunnah, dig, digga tunnah
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.46,1:08:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,土狼啊  来不了啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nevermore the hyena come
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.60,1:08:31.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,土狼啊  来不了啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nevermore the hyena come
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.83,1:08:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歌颂伟大的丁满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sing the praises of brave Timon
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.27,1:08:36.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最勇敢的狐獴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bravest meerkat we've ever known
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.60,1:08:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从没想到  他会帮助辛巴获胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never dreamed he'd help Simba shine
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.07,1:08:41.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实证明和猪交朋友是很酷的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proved it's cool to hang out with swine
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.61,1:08:43.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意外的救星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accidentally saved the day
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.01,1:08:46.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照计行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Planned it so it would look that way
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.11,1:08:48.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我们从沙土中解放出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brought us out of the dirt and sand
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.51,1:08:51.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他的家人带到了幸福之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Led his family to the promised land
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.82,1:08:53.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歌颂伟大的丁满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sing the praises of brave Timon
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.48,1:09:02.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最勇敢的狐獴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravest meerkat we've ever known
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.56,1:09:06.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's it...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.20,1:09:08.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大结局  幸福的结局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the big wrap-up, the happy ending...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.87,1:09:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风光的收场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the grand finale.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.17,1:09:13.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经结束了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over already?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.30,1:09:15.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结局就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Pumbaa, that's the thing about endings.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.21,1:09:17.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后...  就是结局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They come at the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.11,1:09:18.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再看一次好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we watch it again?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.54,1:09:21.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭  我们才刚看过  明天再看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, we ust saw it. Maybe tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.28,1:09:24.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.82,1:09:27.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有告诉我们  你们要看电影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't tell me you were watching the movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.38,1:09:28.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也要看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to watch, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.95,1:09:31.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  我们刚看完  结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma, we just finished. Show's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.66,1:09:33.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你要倒一下带子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're just going to have to rewind it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.32,1:09:34.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.12,1:09:36.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦斯叔叔  我们要看那部电影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Max, we're going to watch the movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.73,1:09:38.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.06,1:09:40.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带来了很多爆米花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I brought extra butter.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.86,1:09:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还要再看一遍?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you guys are watching the movie?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.27,1:09:46.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凡是值得看的故事  就值得多看几遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any story worth telling is worth telling twice.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.64,1:09:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么...  -啊  对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the... - Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.14,1:09:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对不起  -对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me. - Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.34,1:09:52.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对不起  -对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me. - Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.34,1:09:53.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对不起  -闪一边去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me. - Get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.51,1:09:55.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这群人是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this crowd?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.18,1:09:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前面的  坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, down in front!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.58,1:09:59.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎哟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gawrsh!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.95,1:10:01.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aloha!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.92,1:10:08.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.43,1:10:15.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  朋友  你赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, buddy, you win.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.93,1:10:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不介意吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure you don't mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.57,1:10:19.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna Matata
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.30,1:10:20.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘘...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.37,1:10:22.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁满...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.14,1:10:25.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是不习惯太多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still don't do so well in crowds.
